  "notes": [
    "Paths are relative to the repository root, not to this file.",
    "",
    "The launcher sets fill an adaptive-icon layer: a 108 dp square whose",
    "middle 72 dp is the only part a launcher promises to show. The mark spans",
    "mark_dp of that square and is centred, which keeps it inside the safe zone",
    "under every mask and every parallax offset a launcher applies.",
    "",
    "The brand-mark sets are not launcher layers and carry no safe-zone",
    "padding: the first-run screens draw them at their stated size, so a",
    "108 dp layer's empty margin would shrink the mark to two thirds of the",
    "size the caller asked for. brand_mark_dp is the square they are drawn",
    "into at 1x; a screen that asks for 68 dp or 42 dp scales the same file.",
    "The brand lockup sets use a rectangular canvas because the supplied",
    "taffyGo wordmark is part of the artwork and must not be rebuilt as text.",
    "",
    "The splash sets fill the slot the platform reserves for a launch icon",
    "with no icon background: a splash_icon_dp square of which only a centred",
    "circle two thirds as wide survives, everything outside it being masked",
    "away. splash_mark_dp is the largest span at which no pixel of either",
    "master leaves that circle -- measured from the masters rather than",
    "inscribed by arithmetic, because the ribbon's corners are transparent and",
    "strict inscription of the bounding box would waste a tenth of the slot.",
    "There are two, chosen by the night resource qualifier, for the reason",
    "TaffyBrandMark picks between the same two masters: the gradient loses its",
    "edge against the wrong ground. This is the one slot the theme cannot ask",
    "a token for, since the platform draws it before any of this app is",
    "running, so the qualifier follows the system rather than the stored",
    "Appearance choice.",
    "",
    "Every output is encoded losslessly, so the committed bytes are the",
    "resampler's output and nothing else. The artwork is a stand-in: the",
    "launcher background colour and the wider icon set are OD-071."
  ],
